# tally 2.3.1 P42 B1 (L §8.4's RUN-NONE row): min(xn, xh) with xn none and xh a hole names the read and the
# built-in, `xn is none here: min` (a refusal outranks a hole, §8). Before: `a value is none here: min`.
=== b1_min.tally
model b1
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "probe"
input xn: num
input xh: num

ask a: min(xn, xh)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  xn = none "s"
  xh = ?"xh" "s"
=== expect a
a: refused: RUN-NONE xn is none here: min
  cut 2026-06-30
